          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a get-ready-with-me about mental health.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with a single 90cm softbox key at 45 degrees with a white bounce card for fill and grade to Eterna-style muted greens with gentle highlight roll-off.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
